---
description: Use when adding a scheduled report, adding an agent tool, changing the dummy data generator, or comparing or switching LLM models
alwaysApply: false
---

For these tasks, read the matching checklist and follow every step in order:

- Adding or changing a scheduled report: `.claude/skills/add-report/SKILL.md`
- Adding or changing an agent tool: `.claude/skills/add-agent-tool/SKILL.md`
- Changing the dummy data generator: `.claude/skills/update-dummy-data/SKILL.md`
- Comparing or switching models: `.claude/skills/compare-models/SKILL.md`

Rules every one of these tasks must keep (details in `AGENTS.md`):

- The LLM never calculates. The report summary guard and the chat answer
  number guard reject numbers that no tool or report produced.
- The SQL guard refuses personal contact data (`customers.email`, including
  `SELECT *` on customers).
- Percentages are calculated unrounded and rounded once, at display.
- Live eval and model-check runs spend OpenRouter credit: ask the project owner
  first.

These files are shared with Claude Code. Edit the checklist there, not here.
